  "description_text": "Dissatisfied with commercially available card shufflers? This kit was created to elevate both style and function. Please note, this kit includes only the non-3D-printed parts needed to assemble the card shuffler. Inspired by old printing presses with cast iron frames, it boasts a unique, stylistic design that resembles a boiler. Sized for standard playing cards (64x89mm), it can shuffle a full Skip-Bo deck of 160 cards or about 80 sleeved cards.",
